@page "/Prop/avaliacoes"

<MudContainer>
    <MudPaper Elevation="4" Class="pa-4">
        <MudTypography Variant="H4" GutterBottom>
            <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Feedback" /> Gerenciar Avaliações e Feedbacks
        </MudTypography>
        
        <MudGrid>
            <MudItem xs="12" md="4">
                <MudCard>
                    <MudCardContent>
                        <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Reply" Size="Size.Large" Class="mb-2" />
                        <MudTypography Variant="H6">Responder Avaliações de Hóspedes</MudTypography>
                        <MudText>Responda a críticas, tanto positivas quanto negativas, mostrando atenção ao feedback dos hóspedes.</MudText>
                    </MudCardContent>
                    <MudCardActions>
                        <MudButton Color="Color.Primary" Variant="Variant.Outlined">Responder</MudButton>
                    </MudCardActions>
                </MudCard>
            </MudItem>
            
            <MudItem xs="12" md="4">
                <MudCard>
                    <MudCardContent>
                        <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Visibility" Size="Size.Large" Class="mb-2" />
                        <MudTypography Variant="H6">Visualizar Feedbacks Detalhados</MudTypography>
                        <MudText>Consulte as opiniões e sugestões dos hóspedes, visando melhorar a qualidade dos serviços.</MudText>
                    </MudCardContent>
                    <MudCardActions>
                        <MudButton Color="Color.Secondary" Variant="Variant.Outlined">Visualizar</MudButton>
                    </MudCardActions>
                </MudCard>
            </MudItem>
            
            <MudItem xs="12" md="4">
                <MudCard>
                    <MudCardContent>
                        <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Star" Size="Size.Large" Class="mb-2" />
                        <MudTypography Variant="H6">Analisar Classificação do Hotel</MudTypography>
                        <MudText>Avalie a classificação geral do hotel com base nas avaliações dos hóspedes e identifique áreas para melhorias.</MudText>
                    </MudCardContent>
                    <MudCardActions>
                        <MudButton Color="Color.Success" Variant="Variant.Outlined">Analisar</MudButton>
                    </MudCardActions>
                </MudCard>
            </MudItem>
        </MudGrid>
    </MudPaper>
</MudContainer>




